{"id":"anterior","lemma":"anterior","pos":"adj","rank":1541,"glosses":["anterior (in time), previous, earlier, former, past","anterior (in space)"],"ipa":"/anteˈɾjoɾ/","forms":{"femininePlural":"anteriores"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/da/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-anterior.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué pasó el mes anterior?","en":"What happened last month?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/606523","words":[null,null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"month"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what's happening?"]]},{"text":"Lo había comprado la semana anterior.","en":"I'd bought it the week before.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568253","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"makes pluperfect to…"},{"g":"bought"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"week"},null]},{"text":"El acusado no tiene condenas anteriores.","en":"The defendant has no prior convictions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804288","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"accused"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"sentence, punishment","l":"condena"},null]},{"text":"Ojalá hubiera ido al teatro la noche anterior.","en":"I wish I had gone to the theater last night.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1187656","words":[{"g":"I wish"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"away with the fairies"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"theater"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"night"},null]},{"text":"¿Te echaron de tu anterior trabajo?","en":"Did you get fired from your last job?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/581563","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to throw","l":"echar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"work, job"}]}]}